@format 1
@id files.add
@title Add files or folders
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Expand selected files and folders into supported media paths, deduplicate them, and append new list items.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@flow TB
@related files.remove, files.clear

@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[input] Paths supplied <input>
- Receive paths from file dialog, folder dialog, drop, relay, or session restoration @ list.PListPathsAdd(...)
> scan

[scan] Expand supported media <process>
- Recursively scan supplied paths and retain supported media files @ list.PListMediaScan(...)
> append

[append] Add and refresh rows <decision>
- Skip paths already present and create rows for new paths with relay cohort state @ list.PListPathsAdd(...)
- Rebuild the list and select the first scanned path even when every scanned path was already present @ list.PListPathsAdd(...)
? "No supported media path was scanned" > unchanged
? "Only existing paths were scanned" > refreshed
? "One or more paths are new" > result

[result] Files added <output>
= New media rows are visible and the list publishes its items-added event.

[refreshed] Existing file selected <output>
= No row is added, but the list is rebuilt and its first scanned path becomes current; a path-change event is raised.

[unchanged] List unchanged <output>
= No supported media path was found, so the list is not rebuilt or reselection is performed.
